FACTORY_DEF * TeeFactory   FACTORY_NAME "TestFilter_7 <lt>UNFILTERED<gt> Transformer Output Nuker"   INPUT FEATURE_TYPE TestFilter_7_<lt>UNFILTERED<gt>
