<closebracket>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.removeAttribute<openparen><apos>__linedivider.<apos><space>+<space>attr<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>coordSys<space>=<space>feature.getCoordSys<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>outputLines<space>=<space>output.startswith<openparen><apos>Lines<apos><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>outputPoints<space>=<space>output.startswith<openparen><apos>LinesAndPoints<apos><closeparen><space>or<space>output.startswith<openparen><apos>Points<apos><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>outputEndNodes<space>=<space>outputPoints<space>and<space>not<space>output.endswith<openparen><apos>ExceptEndNodes<apos><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Get<space>original<space>curve<space>geometry<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>curve<space>=<space>feature.getGeometry<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>length<space>=<space>curve.getLength<openparen>is3D<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>numLines<space>=<space>int<openparen>round<openparen>value<closeparen><space>if<space>mode<space>==<space><apos>ToNumber<apos><space>else<space>math.ceil<openparen>length<space><solidus><space>value<closeparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>len<space>=<space>value<space>if<space>mode<space>==<space><apos>ToLength<apos><space>else<space>length<space><solidus><space>numLines<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>for<space>n<comma