><space>beg<space>or<space>outputEndNodes<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point<space>=<space>feature.cloneAttributes<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point.setGeometry<openparen>curve.getStartPoint<openparen><closeparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point.setCoordSys<openparen>coordSys<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.pyoutput<openparen>point<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Restore<space>original<space>curve<space>geometry<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>curve<space>=<space>feature.getGeometry<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>if<space>outputEndNodes:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point<space>=<space>feature.cloneAttributes<openparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point.setGeometry<openparen>curve.getEndPoint<openparen><closeparen><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>point.setCoordSys<openparen>coordSys<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.pyoutput<openparen>point<closeparen><lf> }    OUTPUT { PYOUTPUT FEATURE_TYPE "$(Lin